( Experiment 026: lit` and off`/on` )
( These test the lit` assembly word added to ff64.asm )
( and the off`/on` macros added to ff64.boot )

\ Test macro using lit` with byte-sized value
: const42` 42 lit` ;

\ Test macro using lit` with 32-bit value
: biglit` 1000000 lit` ;

\ Test macro using lit` with 64-bit value
: hugelit` $100000000 lit` ;

\ Test macro using lit` with negative byte value
: neg1` -1 lit` ;
